## 10. Priority Tiers — What to Cut if Behind

| Tier | Feature | Cut Strategy |
|---|---|---|
| **P0 — Must Ship** | Mesh send/receive, 4-button SOS + GPS, Firebase upload, Dashboard map | Without these, no demo. |
| **P1 — High Impact** | Volume SOS, Bulletin from Dashboard → phone, ACK flow | Easy to build, massive demo value. |
| **P2 — Differentiator** | Captive Portal, Dead Man's Switch | Cut if behind schedule. Mention as "designed." |
| **P3 — Polish** | Bloom filter sync, Power Saver mode, GPS cross-validation | Show in slides only. |

